# Tuning taxi flights and rentals

## Prices

| Setting | Where | Default |
|---|---|---|
| Taxi ride price | Economy & prices | $3 |
| Rental price | Economy & prices | $50 |

Both are taken from the player's **cash**. 0 makes it free.

## Faster or slower taxi rides

In **Taxi rides**:

| Setting | What it does | Default |
|---|---|---|
| Travel speed | Normal cruising speed | 22 m/s |
| "Step on it" speed | Speed when the passenger asks to hurry | 30 m/s |
| Cruising altitude | Height above the ground | 80 m |
| Climb speed | How fast it rises after take-off | 5 m/s |
| Landing speed | Top sink speed while landing | 20 m/s |

Tips:

- **Balloon hits hills?** Raise **Cruising altitude**.
- **Landing too rough?** Lower **Landing speed**.
- **Rides feel too long?** Raise **Travel speed** a little at a time.

## After landing

| Setting | What it does | Default |
|---|---|---|
| Wait for passenger to exit | Time before the passenger is moved out | 30 seconds |
| Rise time before despawn | How long the empty balloon rises away | 30 seconds |
| Extra time before despawn | More rising before it is deleted | 10 seconds |

## Rental length

In **Rentals & flying** → **Rental time**:

- **Rental length** — how long a rental lasts, in minutes (default 60).
- **Expiry warning** — minutes of warning before it ends (default 5).

The menu shows the real length. The "Your balloon is ready! Rental expires in 1 hour." message is plain text: edit `rental_ready` in **Text & language** if you change the length.

## Captain climb and descend

In **Rentals & flying** (these apply to anyone flying a balloon themselves):

- Keep **Scripted climb** on. Without it, Shift often does nothing on current game builds.
- **Top climb speed** and **Top descend speed** set how fast Shift and Ctrl move the balloon.
- Turn off **Ctrl descends** if you want balloons to only sink on their own.
